Package: aigifmaker
Type: Package
Title: Turn Text into Animated GIFs with 'AI GIF Maker'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("AI GIF Maker", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@aigifmaker.ai")
Description: Official SDK for 'AI GIF Maker' <https://aigifmaker.ai>: turn text
    into animated GIFs. Native GIF generation, no video conversion. Send a
    prompt with your 'AI GIF Maker' API key, wait for the GIF URL, and check
    your remaining credits.
